      "zh-TW": "同 ETC 0x 地址跨池有獨立帳本，換連線改後續份額，不自動清舊待付或移入新池。",
      "en": "The same ETC 0x address can have independent ledgers on different pools. Changing the connection routes future shares; it does not automatically clear the old unpaid balance or transfer it into the new pool.",
